 "brief": "The al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released footage showing field commander Youssef Namer Zaghra supervising ambushes and directing attacks against Israeli soldiers and vehicles, Shehab Wire reported. Zaghra commanded the Radwan Battalion within Gaza Brigade. The video depicts the commander overseeing tactical operations during combat engagement.\n\nThe release represents the latest in an ongoing series of communications from the armed faction documenting operational activities. The brigades have regularly distributed video material purporting to show combat operations and the role of senior commanders throughout the conflict.",
